  "Scenes.Antsscene.TalkAboutAntHistory.AfterDemonsInquiry": "[pg]You inquire what happened after the demons came. [say: It was difficult; we were almost driven to extinction. Whole colonies became corrupted, and because our race only produces a few female eggs, most colonies quickly just turned into massive...] Her voice cuts, as if she didn't want to say the next word."
