  "Scenes.Antsscene.TalkAboutAntHistory.InterruptWithKiss": "[pg]Before she finishes her sentence, you pull her to you and kiss her deeply."
  "Scenes.Antsscene.TalkAboutAntHistory.KnowingPriorFates": "[pg]Knowing exactly what has happened to those who came before you makes what you're about to say all the sweeter. You tell Phylla that there have been others before you, and you explain in vivid detail about the factory: how your people were sent as sacrifices, and how Phylla's people could have stopped this if they had even an ounce of courage and intellect to stop them."
